Package: asgard-network-services
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: metapackages
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 asgard-gnome-desktop,
 avahi-daemon,
 libnss-mdns,
 libproxy1-plugin-networkmanager,
 libproxy1-plugin-gsettings,
 libproxy1-plugin-webkit
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ network discovery + proxy resolution
 Adds the network-level conveniences that polish desktop network
 behavior on laptop / mobile use:
 .
   * avahi-daemon                       mDNS / Bonjour service
                                        discovery (.local resolution,
                                        airprint, chromecast, etc.)
   * libnss-mdns                        glibc NSS resolver plugin
                                        wiring .local through avahi
   * libproxy1-plugin-networkmanager    libproxy NM autodetect plugin
   * libproxy1-plugin-gsettings         libproxy GSettings autodetect
   * libproxy1-plugin-webkit            libproxy WebKit autoconfig
                                        URL evaluator
 .
 None of these are required for basic networking (NetworkManager in
 asgard-gnome-desktop covers that) — they make discovery + proxy
 handling Just Work without operator config on networks that use
 mDNS or proxy auto-config.
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop.
